{
  "html": "\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 18px 18px 24px; background-color: #faf7f0; color: #201e1a; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; overflow-wrap: anywhere\" data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"border-top: 3px solid #1e1c18; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1c18; padding: 5px 0 6px; margin: 0 0 14px; display: table; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: table-cell; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e1c18\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eSUNDAY EDITION\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: table-cell; text-align: right; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: #8b1e1e; font-weight: 700\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eWEEKEND REVIEW\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; padding: 0 0 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #d2cab9\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #2b2722; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 15.5px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #1e1c18; display: inline-block; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 0.95; margin-right: 6px\"\u003e周\u003c/span\u003e日清晨摊开一份厚实的大报，双粗细栏线、大号首字与舒展衬线字让深度阅读重新慢下来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 22px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid #1e1c18\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: block; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2.5px; color: #8b1e1e; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eSECTION\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #8b1e1e\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eI\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #8b1e1e\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: inline; margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.8px; color: #1a1815\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e把长篇观点排成头版特稿\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #201e1a; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 15px\"\u003e象牙报纸底配罗马数字大号眉标与粗黑底线，首屏完全不塞图片，仅靠报刊栏线与字距撑起分量。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 16px 0; padding: 12px 16px; border-top: 2px solid #1e1c18; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1c18; background-color: #f3eee2\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"border: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #2a251e; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 15.5px; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0\"\u003e真正值得反复重读的观点，经得起纸面般的克制留白。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 22px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid #1e1c18\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: block; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2.5px; color: #8b1e1e; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eSECTION\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #8b1e1e\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003eII\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #8b1e1e\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: inline; margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.8px; color: #1a1815\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e报刊风排版的层次控制\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #201e1a; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0 0 15px\"\u003e双粗细顶线确立周末专栏仪式感，粗细双线引用块自然拎出核心判断，适合深度评论与人物特稿。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #2b2722; background-color: #ffffff\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/minimal-architecture.jpg\" alt=\"阳光洒在极简建筑线条上的光影\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 22px 0 0; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 3px double #1e1c18; text-align: center\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #544d42; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 13.5px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; text-align: center\"\u003e好的版式不抢戏，只替文字守住分寸与重量。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: block; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: #8b1e1e\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e■ ■ ■\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
